# Normalize line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Codegen always writes LF (`code-block-writer`'s default), and the write path
# compares generated content against the file on disk byte-for-byte. Without
# `eol=lf`, Windows Git's default `core.autocrlf=true` checks the committed
# `confect/_generated/**` files out as CRLF, so every `confect codegen` run
# reports every file as modified — which makes `confect dev` churn through its
# write/watch/regenerate loop forever and leaves `verify-codegen-committed`
# permanently failing.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
